# Local stand-in for Cloud Scheduler: the same endpoints on the same timetable (UTC).
*/5 * * * * curl -s -X POST http://generation-worker:8000/internal/schedules/sweep
*/10 * * * * curl -s -X POST http://generation-worker:8000/internal/schedules/key-check-batches
0 3 * * * curl -s -X POST http://generation-worker:8000/internal/schedules/retention
15 3 * * * curl -s -X POST http://companies:8000/internal/schedules/retention
30 3 * * * curl -s -X POST http://companies:8000/internal/schedules/invite-expiry
0 9 * * * curl -s -X POST http://companies:8000/internal/schedules/invite-reminders
45 3 * * * curl -s -X POST http://library:8000/internal/schedules/bank
# The activity digest and reminders to company members (notifications), every 10 minutes for an
# hour each morning.
*/10 7 * * * curl -s -X POST http://notifications:8000/internal/schedules/digest
*/10 8 * * * curl -s -X POST http://notifications:8000/internal/schedules/reminders
# ATS candidates whose invite stalled, and old ones (the ats service), every 10 minutes.
*/10 * * * * curl -s -X POST http://ats:8000/internal/schedules/recover
# Events companies' web hooks didn't take (the api service), every 5 minutes.
*/5 * * * * curl -s -X POST http://api:8000/internal/schedules/webhook-retries
# Events not published right after their change (the outbox), every minute.
* * * * * curl -s -X POST http://library:8000/internal/schedules/outbox
* * * * * curl -s -X POST http://companies:8000/internal/schedules/outbox
* * * * * curl -s -X POST http://rounds:8000/internal/schedules/outbox
* * * * * curl -s -X POST http://generation-worker:8000/internal/schedules/outbox
* * * * * curl -s -X POST http://ats:8000/internal/schedules/outbox
# Interviews whose time ran out after the candidate left, every minute.
* * * * * curl -s -X POST http://rounds:8000/internal/schedules/expire-interviews
